          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "വെളിപ്പെടുത്തുക (veḷippeṭuttuka) is native Dravidian: വെളി (veḷi), \"an open field; the outside\" (DEDR 5498), with -പ്പെടുത്തുക, \"to cause to be\". To reveal is to put a thing out in the open."
            }
          ]
        },
